---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { useTranslations } from '../../../i18n/utils';

const lang = 'en' as const;
const t = useTranslations(lang);
---
<Layout title={t('footer.about')} description="Learn about the team and vision behind OMXHub">
  <section class="wrap section">
    <h1>About OMXHub</h1>
    <p>
      OMXHub is an Arabic-first directory dedicated to AI tools, built to help
      Arabic-speaking users discover, compare, and understand the best AI tools
      available today — with clear, direct explanations and no unnecessary
      technical complexity.
    </p>
    <p>
      The site is an independent project run by Omar Zaberi, started with a
      simple goal: provide a trustworthy Arabic-language resource that covers
      every AI tool in depth — features, drawbacks, pricing, and how to use it —
      instead of forcing readers to piece things together from scattered
      English sources.
    </p>
    <p>
      We review every tool ourselves and update content regularly to keep up
      with the fast pace of AI. If you have a suggestion or a tool you'd like
      added, feel free to reach out via the <a href="/en/contact">contact page</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      OMXHub is fully independent with no outside investment. If you've found
      the site useful and want to help us keep building and keep it free for
      everyone, you can <a href="/en/support">support us here ❤️</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .section { padding: 60px 0; max-width: 700px; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  p { margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-dim); }
  p a { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
